<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- F23 revert-guard: the Glance widget used to reuse `ic_launcher_foreground`
     and draw it untinted on the dynamic `primaryContainer` (56 dp box). In the
     dark scheme that is ink #1B1E18 on #4F378B — 1.81:1, nearly invisible. This
     drawable is a SELF-CONTAINED paper plate with the ink mark on it, so the
     widget reads on both schemes without relying on a tint: paper #F1EEE4
     against #4F378B is 8.03:1 and ink against paper is 14.52:1. On the light
     primaryContainer the plate blends in (1.11:1) but the ink glyph itself is
     13.08:1, so the mark stays readable on both schemes. -->
